          <h3>S-3 Research</h3>
          <p>Builds data science and AI-enabled tools that make complex cli=
nical research information more accessible, useful, and actionable.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Responsible AI and data science</li>
            <li>Clinical trial intelligence</li>
            <li>Digital engagement tools</li>
          </ul>
          <a href=3D"https://www.s-3.io/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener=
">Visit S-3 Research <span aria-hidden=3D"true">=E2=86=97</span></a>
