        <div>
          <div class=3D"section-label">Collaboration products</div>
          <h2>Shared capabilities.<br>Solutions in action.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each product illustrates how clinical expertise, community relat=
ionships, research operations, and technology can work together across the =
research journey.</p>
