        <h2>A closer look at collaboration in action.</h2>
        <p>TrialChat brings S-3 Research=E2=80=99s AI-enabled technology to=
gether with ACHIEVE=E2=80=99s clinician- and patient-centered approach. The=
 result is a conversational guide designed to make clinical research inform=
ation easier for patients and caregivers to understand.</p>
